Let's start by discussing the logic behind virtual storage space. This is a single virtual
representation of several physical spaces on your hard drive (or hard drives). A storage
space will be seen as a single area where a specific group of eBooks is stored. I use the term
"stored" loosely because the storage space doesn't exist. It's more representative of a
grouping than a physical space on the hard drive:
